  "policy": "Canonical, hash-pinned TTF inputs support repository browser consumers. Approved social exports are immutable raster inputs and do not use repository fonts. Browser consumers receive deterministic WOFF2 outputs only. IBM Plex remains complete for documentation and localized fallback coverage; Newsreader is a website-only editorial subset.",
